    "methodology": "Local Inference Lab llm-inference-bench v0.6.2 (commit ccd9ad8, SHA-256 053989ed...) with the flags of rtx6kpro/benchmarks/prepared-b12x-serving/ds41, run directly against the engine port. Prefill: standalone cold profile, unique prompts with exact /tokenize targeting, 30 s windows, input tokens divided by client TTFT. Decode: 30 s sustained cells after 15 s warmup, temperature 1, EOS respected, max 8192 tokens. Only the first of three decode passes ran and C4/C8 at 32k context are missing, so decode rows are single samples, not protocol medians. GPUs capped at 275 W, stock clocks, driver 595.84. Server ran without --enable-metrics, so effective concurrency and DSpark acceptance were not validated by the harness.",
